e requirement own_fault_instance_consuming_relationship_and_event_semantics. The effective authority is S1.P05.S08 as corrected by S1.P05.S08.C01 and consolidated by the published S1.P05 phase closure, under which S1.P06 receives exactly one immediate subject, two requirements, and three prohibitions. The superseded owner topology is not resurrected here.","prohibition_count":3,"received_subject_count":1,"requirement_count":2,"superseded_handoff_id":"handoff:s1-p05-s08:s1-p06"},"format":{"audience":"internal","calibration":"case-calibrated","canonicalization":{"array_order":"declared_disposition_order","encoding":"UTF-8_without_BOM","exactly_one_trailing_lf":true,"floats_and_NaN_permitted":false,"keys":"sorted","line_endings":"LF_only","name":"json-sort-keys-compact-utf8-lf-v1","whitespace":"compact"},"classification":"internal_phase_governance_disposition_and_readiness_layer","created_at":"2026-09-10T09:40:00Z","name":"faultatlas-fault-instance-deferred-subject-disposition-readiness","non_production_schema_warning":"not_a_production_schema_class_wire_format_adapter_reader_writer_migration_persistence_contract_or_public_API","primary_authority":"decision.json_is_the_sole_durable_semantic_authority_and_decision.md_is_derived","production_persistence":false,"public_contract":false,"sealed_at":"2026-09-10T09:40:00Z","status":"sealed_complete","version":"1"},"inherited_subject_register":{"addressed_count":1,"carried_forward_count":0,"count":1,"dispositioned_exactly_once":1,"immediate_owner_totals":{},"items":[{"addressed_by":["S1.P06.S04","S1.P06.S05","S1.P06.S06","S1.P06.S08","S1.P06.S09"],"disposition":"addressed","disposition_id":"disposition:s1-p06-s10:01","effective_scope":"own_the_bounded_domain_relationship_vocabulary_needed_by_FaultInstance","outcome":"satisfied_under_effective_S1.P05.S08.C01_scope","rationale":"The carried-forward wording is \"universal relationship vocabulary\", and \"universal\" there names the predecessor's phrasing rather than a required capability. S1.P05.S08.C01 narrowed the effective obligation to the bounded domain relationship vocabulary needed by FaultInstance, and the S1.P05 phase closure carries that narrowed obligation forward as the single immediate subject S1.P06 receives. S1.P06 has supplied that bounded vocabulary as eight explicit typed contracts rather than one generic relation schema: a report to source-object association and a report to bounded history-fact association in S1.P06.S04; a repair candidate to immutable revision association and a repair candidate to supplied change-set association in S1.P06.S05; a reported run to revision association and a reported before-and-after comparison in S1.P06.S06; the bounded reference-integrity relations of the composition in S1.P06.S08; and the substantive record to durable evidence-record association in S1.P06.S09. Each names its two endpoints by published type, so no Relationship, Edge, Graph, RelationKind, registry, or provider-independent relationship ontology was needed and none was published. The obligation is therefore fulfilled under its effective scope, with no P06-owned remainder and no later owner.","source":{"carried_forward_wording":"universal relationship vocabulary","effective_authority":"S1.P05.S08.C01","json_pointer":"/p06_handoff","path":"reference_corpus/contracts/development-history/closures/s1-p05-phase-closure/closure.json","sha256":"9f5ff594a841ccca1c9ff05d286f3cf774a87ebdd4b7da4c07facf7a62afed23","source_artifact":"S1.P05_phase_closure","source_state":"unsupported_current_scope","source_wording":"case relationship vocabulary provisional","subject_id":"gap:s05-known:case-relationship-vocabulary-provisional"},"subject":"case relationship vocabulary provisional"}],"long_term_owner_totals":{},"owner_completeness":true,"self_introduced_count":0,"self_owned_open":0,"split_count":0,"state_totals":{}},"non_generalizations":{"count":9,"intentional_deferral_is_not_implementation_failure":true,"items":["FaultAtlas publishes no univ